{"4544450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Athletics 99", "steam_appid": 4544450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4778530], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Athletics 99</strong></i> is the one and only athletics simulator. Dive into a real-sized track and start competing in <strong>18 different contests,</strong> where every mechanic represents faithfully its real counterpart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/e3417333b288c8edd4d6f189725f39c8.avif?t=1786708887\" width=168 height=218 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/57e6a99f12c6be9202c2c94ff55c29ca.avif?t=1786708887\" width=168 height=218 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/1af50d60425a1ea3938fcf3dd9388dbb.avif?t=1786708887\" width=168 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can  customize your athete, choose the country you'll represent, and try to beat the global leaderboards as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, you might end up learning a thing or two about warmups, streching and technique in the meantime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/3fe6d201063c8331d55fb7e9443d00b2.avif?t=1786708887\" alt=\"800_metre_race_icon\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running contests require great reflexes. Some of them use <u>starting blocks,</u> some include obstacles such as <u>hurdles,</u> and some require passing a <u>baton</u> in a coordinated team effort to win. Whatever the case is, try to arrive to the <u>finish line</u> before anyone else! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Speed races (100m, 200m...)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Middle distance (800m, 1500m)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Obstacles (110m hurdles, 3000m steeplechase...)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Relays (4x100m, 4x400m)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Jump!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/67eecef596f13aa293b67d9532fb629e.avif?t=1786708887\" alt=\"high_jump_icon\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These contests are about technique and concentration. You don't want to step over the <u>take-off line</u> or set the <u>bar</u> too high on your first try. Practice make perfect; hop, step, jump!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pit jumps (Long, Triple)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>High jump</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pole vault</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Throw!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/26b37c989ec395ca7659599702be9722.avif?t=1786708887\" alt=\"discus_throw_icon\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it with you muscles, but also with the help of physics. The more momentum you gain before launching the projectile, whether it's a <u>hammer</u> or a <u>disc</u>, the further it will land. Be careful not to make a <u>foul</u> throw, though.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Shot Put</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Caged throws (Disc, Hammer)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Javelin throw</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athletics 99</i> also features different CPU difficulties &amp; several day times to play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Athletics 99</strong></i> is the one and only athletics simulator. Dive into a real-sized track and start competing in <strong>18 different contests,</strong> where every mechanic represents faithfully its real counterpart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/e3417333b288c8edd4d6f189725f39c8.avif?t=1786708887\" width=168 height=218 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/57e6a99f12c6be9202c2c94ff55c29ca.avif?t=1786708887\" width=168 height=218 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/1af50d60425a1ea3938fcf3dd9388dbb.avif?t=1786708887\" width=168 height=218 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can  customize your athete, choose the country you'll represent, and try to beat the global leaderboards as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, you might end up learning a thing or two about warmups, streching and technique in the meantime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/3fe6d201063c8331d55fb7e9443d00b2.avif?t=1786708887\" alt=\"800_metre_race_icon\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running contests require great reflexes. Some of them use <u>starting blocks,</u> some include obstacles such as <u>hurdles,</u> and some require passing a <u>baton</u> in a coordinated team effort to win. Whatever the case is, try to arrive to the <u>finish line</u> before anyone else! </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Speed races (100m, 200m...)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Middle distance (800m, 1500m)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Obstacles (110m hurdles, 3000m steeplechase...)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Relays (4x100m, 4x400m)</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Jump!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/67eecef596f13aa293b67d9532fb629e.avif?t=1786708887\" alt=\"high_jump_icon\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These contests are about technique and concentration. You don't want to step over the <u>take-off line</u> or set the <u>bar</u> too high on your first try. Practice make perfect; hop, step, jump!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pit jumps (Long, Triple)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>High jump</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Pole vault</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Throw!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4544450/extras/26b37c989ec395ca7659599702be9722.avif?t=1786708887\" alt=\"discus_throw_icon\" width=250 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it with you muscles, but also with the help of physics. The more momentum you gain before launching the projectile, whether it's a <u>hammer</u> or a <u>disc</u>, the further it will land. Be careful not to make a <u>foul</u> throw, though.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Shot Put</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Caged throws (Disc, Hammer)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Javelin throw</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Athletics 99</i> also features different CPU difficulties &amp; several day times to play.</p>", "short_description": "Run! Jump! Throw! Compete in the Athletics World Cup through 18 different events, and represent your country against worldwide athletes. Who knows, you might even break some World Records...", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image"